00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:39.650
It’s been shortened over time.

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:41.320
Technically, it’s Aristoteles.

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:42.760
Sounds a little more Greek, doesn’t it?

00:05:42.760 --> 00:05:48.080
I actually include the original Greek spelling
